### Analysis
## Container field included in request without required beta headers

**What fails\:** The container field is included in the API request whenever `anthropicOptions?.container` exists\, even if it contains no skills\. However\, beta headers \(`code-execution-2025-08-25`\, `skills-2025-10-02`\, `files-api-2025-04-14`\) are only added when `container.skills.length > 0`\, creating an inconsistency\.

**How to reproduce\:**

```typescript
// Pass a container with ID but no skills
