## Inconsistent provider metadata keys in OpenAI\-compatible responses language model

**What fails\:** OpenAICompatibleResponsesLanguageModel uses hard\-coded `"openai"` or literal string `"providerOptionsName"` keys instead of the actual provider name when constructing providerMetadata objects in both doGenerate\(\) and doStream\(\) methods\.

**How to reproduce\:**

```typescript
