## Missing `include` parameter in OpenAICompatibleResponsesLanguageModel request

**What fails\:** The `getArgs()` method in `openai-compatible-responses-language-model.ts` constructs an `include` variable but never includes it in the returned request body\, causing user\-provided `include` options and automatically\-added `reasoning.encrypted_content` to be silently ignored when sending API requests\.

**How to reproduce\:** Pass an `include` parameter via provider options\:

```typescript
