**Expected behavior\:** The constructed `include` array should be sent in the API request body\. When `store === false` and `reasoningEffort` is set\, the code automatically adds `'reasoning.encrypted_content'` to the include array \(lines 171\-172\)\, but this array is never included in the request sent to the API\.

