## Missing viewImage and viewXVideo tool handling in xAI Responses prepare tools function

**What fails\:** The `viewImage` and `viewXVideo` provider\-defined tools exported from `packages/xai/src/tool/index.ts` are not handled in the `prepareResponsesTools()` function in `xai-responses-prepare-tools.ts`\. When these tools are passed to the function with ids `'xai.view_image'` and `'xai.view_x_video'`\, they fall through to the default case and are marked as unsupported tools\, preventing users from requesting these tools even though the xAI API can return `view_image_call` and `view_x_video_call` events\.

**How to reproduce\:**

```typescript
