**Fix implemented\:** Added cases for `'xai.view_image'` and `'xai.view_x_video'` in the switch statement within `prepareResponsesTools()` to push the appropriate tool types to `xaiTools`\. Also added corresponding entries to the `XaiResponsesToolChoice` type union and `XaiResponsesTool` type union in `xai-responses-api.ts`\, and added tool choice mapping cases for these tools\. Tests added to verify the tools are properly prepared and can be used in tool choice scenarios\.

