## Double parsing in secureJsonParse when errors occur

**What fails\:** `secureJsonParse()` in `packages/provider-utils/src/secure-json-parse.ts` calls `_parse()` twice when JSON parsing fails or security checks detect prototype pollution\, causing unnecessary double\-parsing and redundant error throwing\.

**How to reproduce\:**

```typescript
