**What fails\:** The `pollForImageUrl()` method in `packages/black-forest-labs/src/bfl-image-model.ts` doesn\'t accept or use request\-specific headers passed to `doGenerate()`\. This causes custom headers \(authentication\, proxy headers\, etc\.\) to only be sent to the initial image submission request but not to any polling requests\.

