## Inconsistent seed parameter handling in BlackForestLabsImageModel

**What fails\:** The seed parameter from `bflOptions` is unconditionally added to the request body even when null or undefined\, while all other optional parameters \(11 fields\) use `!= null` checks to omit null\/undefined values\.

**How to reproduce\:**

