```

This matches the pattern used for safety\_tolerance\, webhook\_url\, and all other optional parameters in the same function\, ensuring consistent and predictable request body construction\.

**Context\:** [Black Forest Labs API documentation](https://docs.bfl.ml/api-reference/tasks/generate-an-image-with-flux-11-%5Bpro%5D-finetune-with-ultra-mode) specifies seed as `integer | null` and states \"If not provided\, a random seed will be used\.\" While null is technically valid per the API spec\, code maintainability requires consistent patterns across all optional parameters\.

