### Analysis
## URL sources from retrievedContext incorrectly receive \'Unknown Document\' title instead of undefined

**What fails\:** In `extractSources()` function in `packages/google/src/google-generative-ai-language-model.ts`\, URL sources from `retrievedContext` \(those with HTTP\/HTTPS URIs\) receive `title: 'Unknown Document'` as a default when no title is provided\. This breaks backward compatibility and creates inconsistency with web URL sources\, which use `title: undefined`\.

**How to reproduce\:**

```typescript
