## Missing metrics recording for early\-error stream scenarios in streamText\(\)

**What fails\:** The `DefaultStreamTextResult.flush()` method returns early when no steps are recorded \(error scenario\)\, bypassing all metrics recording\. This causes failed requests that error before generating any output to have zero telemetry data recorded\, making them invisible in monitoring\.

