## Nested empty object schemas lose their description field during conversion

**What fails\:** `convertJSONSchemaToOpenAPISchema()` in `packages/google/src/convert-json-schema-to-openapi-schema.ts` drops the `description` field from nested empty object schemas when converting from JSON Schema to OpenAPI Schema\.

