The parseMultipart function in packages/prodia/src/prodia-image-model.ts had multiple out-of-bounds access vulnerabilities:

1. **Line 368 (partStart check)**: The code was directly accessing `data[partStart + 1]` without verifying that `partStart + 1 < data.length`. If partStart is at or near the end of the data array, this would read beyond the array bounds.

