The `getHost()` helper here only swaps the hostname, but the version path is still hardcoded as `/v1beta1` in the return statement just below:

https://github.com/vercel/ai/blob/43e84c8e39e540aa23e25986031183227a77d531/packages/google-vertex/src/google-vertex-provider-base.ts#L171

So for us/eu this still produces:

