The official Vertex AI docs use `/v1` (not `/v1beta1`) for the multi-region REP endpoints. The `generateContent` curl example for the us/eu multi-region endpoint
  is:

```curl
  API_ENDPOINT="https://aiplatform.${GOOGLE_CLOUD_LOCATION}.rep.googleapis.com"

  curl -X POST \
    -H "Authorization: Bearer $(gcloud auth print-access-token)" \
