    "${API_ENDPOINT}/v1/projects/${GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT}/locations/${GOOGLE_CLOUD_LOCATION}/publishers/google/models/${MODEL_ID}:generateContent"
```

The affected models (gemini-3.5-flash, gemini-3.1-flash-lite) are Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform (GEAP) models, and the GEAP generateContent REST  reference is published under /v1 as well.

